# Free Mapillary "Client Token" for the map's Street View feature —
# get one at https://www.mapillary.com/dashboard/developers (looks
# like "MLY|..."). Without it, Street View stays visibly disabled
# rather than silently failing.
VITE_MAPILLARY_TOKEN=

# LiveKit server WS URL (e.g. wss://your-project.livekit.cloud) for
# VoicePanel.tsx's browser mic publisher. This is a public endpoint, not a
# secret — the actual LiveKit API key/secret stay server-side
# (src/monkey_brain/kernel/edge/livekit_adapter.py's LIVEKIT_API_KEY/
# LIVEKIT_API_SECRET) and are never sent to the browser; only a short-TTL,
# room-scoped token from POST /voice/sessions is.
VITE_LIVEKIT_URL=
